#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:84
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:85
msgid ""
"**Compact type scale**: The range is 12px–70px with a dramatic jump — "
"most functional text is 12–16px, creating a dense, app-like information "
"hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:86
msgid ""
"**Warm weight distribution**: 600–700 for headings, 400–500 for body. No "
"ultra-light weights — the type always feels substantial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:87
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking on headings**: -1.2px on 28px headings creates cozy, "
"intimate section titles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:88
msgid ""
"**Single font family**: Pin Sans handles everything — no secondary "
"display or monospace font detected."
msgstr ""

