#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:181
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_pinterest.md:182
msgid ""
"Use warm neutrals (`#e5e5e0`, `#e0e0d9`, `#91918c`) — the warm olive/sand"
" tone is the identity"
